Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.87,0:00:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌那段真的好棒喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.21,0:00:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那個凹凸不平的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.42,0:00:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,然後砰地變成嘎的那段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.09,0:00:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在說哪一段？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.34,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是漫畫版嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.26,0:00:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是閃亮萌寵第四話吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 說不定是喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,為何只憑剛才那樣就聽得懂？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學果然是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦 是我妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.44,0:00:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是我妹喜歡 我妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.24,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,特別是第四話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:36.78,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能和人聊閃萌 真的好幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.29,0:00:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,動畫現在播到第幾話了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,第14話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:47.71,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,藍光第二集也快出了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,順帶一提 第一集裡面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.01,0:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,有收錄夢幻的第零話當特典
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:54.88,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,知道得真清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是啥 超在意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.85,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.39,0:01:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,藍光可以借妳看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.85,0:01:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:03.31,0:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天放學後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就去阿宅家看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.64,0:01:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好 當然…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.15,0:01:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我家？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:09.65,0:01:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知… 妳這也太…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.07,0:01:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,天音很討厭男生啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.44,0:01:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我家不太方便 我房間很亂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.32,0:01:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,而且既然天音同學不喜歡 就更…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.83,0:01:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是有什麼見不得人的東西嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.25,0:01:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,像是… 自己畫的閃萌插畫之類的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.79,0:01:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.80,0:01:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.21,0:01:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我還是第一次聽說你在畫閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.55,0:01:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,教我怎麼畫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.76,0:01:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 等一下…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.30,0:01:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我妹叫我畫閃萌 我才要練習
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.43,0:01:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 放學後就衝阿宅家\n-會畫萬普嗎？我最推萬普 你能畫好嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:47.10,0:01:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.52,0:01:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到整理得很乾淨嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.15,0:01:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以畫在哪裡？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.49,0:02:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,畢業紀念冊呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.91,0:02:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.33,0:02:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,最強辣妹二人組竟然來到我房間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.87,0:02:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,身為阿宅的我到底該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦？怎麼辦？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.96,0:02:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.72,0:03:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪裡有對阿宅溫柔的辣妹？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.05,0:03:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第二節\n我的房間變成辣妹的聚會場所？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次請人來家裡玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.97,0:03:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,偏偏是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,周邊好壯觀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.85,0:03:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是地球大人的限定獎品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管夾幾次都夾不到說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.07,0:04:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,畢業紀念冊在哪裡呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,請不要隨便亂動…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.45,0:04:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,推廣用光碟的話 要多少的我都借
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.91,0:04:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,請務必帶回家慢慢看…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,欸？為什麼？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.54,0:04:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,就說了要一起看嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.30,0:04:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,碰到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-伊地知 那是性騷擾\n-哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 不要跟我一起看比較好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.51,0:04:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我會很吵…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.60,0:04:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,像演唱會那樣揮舞螢光棒亂叫？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.81,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 倒不會到那種程度…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.56,0:04:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不會嗎…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.73,0:04:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妳會嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那… 那個…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.78,0:04:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,與其說不會那樣做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.57,0:04:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,其實是因為害羞而不做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.03,0:04:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有人會那樣我也無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.41,0:04:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你都怎麼做？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,做應援扇或把房間弄暗之類的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,玩真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很有趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.42,0:05:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我也好想試試看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.80,0:05:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,可… 可以嗎？我真的會大叫喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.14,0:05:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看到天音嶄新的一面了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我會對喜歡的場面表現尊敬
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,或是實況演說演出或作畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.02,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那不就是平常的你嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很… 很誇張喔 就像是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出全力的阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.65,0:05:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺好嗨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.63,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（閃亮萌寵）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.29,0:05:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好 來看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨起來了 嗨起來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣很棒耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,讓人超興奮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.35,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小光 妳來了嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.52,0:05:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,原本在吵架的小光
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然來了 真的是… 我不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,小光對佐知子來說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.65,0:06:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是第一個人類朋友呢…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.90,0:06:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那是當然啊 走吧 佐知子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:06.44,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小光
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.20,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,同步了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,妳以為贏得了我嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,蛇后 少在那邊廢話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,出現啦！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,神祕少女和蛇后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.75,0:06:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要上囉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,太帥了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也太美少女了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,深得我心…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,明明連名字都還沒揭曉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,人氣卻勇奪第一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.51,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這鏡頭是作畫的外街老師\n堅持到最後一刻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,呈現出的精華片段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,實況兼解說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.65,0:06:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,太開心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.86,0:06:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然能宅力全開大吵大鬧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.49,0:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,活著真是太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.50,0:06:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下要來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.00,0:07:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡帕契會稍微露臉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學在摸我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.21,0:07:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 又暗又近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.09,0:07:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,還有好香的味道 心臟好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.84,0:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.09,0:07:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-什麼都聽不進去了…\n-宅… 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 你有認真看嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉 太近了\n-對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妳在拍什麼？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我不會給別人看嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,稀有天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.53,0:07:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-得手\n-刪掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.66,0:07:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那把剛才的照片傳到Mins好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.87,0:07:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,騙妳的 開玩笑的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.25,0:07:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,說起來 天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,妳不是想看阿宅畫的圖嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.01,0:07:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他有發在Mins上喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我你的Mins帳號
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.06,0:07:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,顏值好高
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.77,0:08:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不 真的不是什麼了不起的作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼 那很珍貴耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.65,0:08:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌的二創又不多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這倒也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.15,0:08:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,換作是我也會想看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,請不要嫌我噁心喔…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,明明說不會嫌棄的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.46,0:08:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你的帳號名稱是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.13,0:08:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅 海洋？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.00,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼什麼 阿宅很有名嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沒那回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.55,0:08:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,追蹤人數還不到50人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.01,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,妳… 妳是怎麼知道的？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.01,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我就是那50人之一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭 好帥…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.89,0:08:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,當然是用只看不發的私帳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.56,0:08:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我在搜"閃萌二創"的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.40,0:08:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看到畫得很棒的圖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.07,0:08:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.19,0:08:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然害羞 但我很高興
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那妳應該也知道"閃亮大叔"吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.66,0:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,知道！他的閃萌圖根本神
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.37,0:09:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你們兩個人私下有交往？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,說法不對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.00,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.34,0:09:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣那樣…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,後來變成教她怎麼畫畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.43,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你有繪圖板啊 真棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺很好畫呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.14,0:09:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好… 好近…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,總之要畫畫看嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.81,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎？謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好… 這樣我也要成為生產者了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學果然是阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.78,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 伊地知同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.45,0:09:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,妳一個人很無聊？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.33,0:09:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,總…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.83,0:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得好色…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.79,0:09:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.25,0:09:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 那個…\n我不太擅長顧慮他人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事沒事 我習慣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.84,0:10:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只要跟天音在一起\n大家都會把我丟一旁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,拚命想找天音說話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也常被這樣對待喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,對方對妳有意思的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:10.36,0:10:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我們太受歡迎 也很傷腦筋呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.40,0:10:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但實在不喜歡表現得太露骨的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.86,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那種"其他人怎樣都無所謂"的感覺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很不舒服呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.87,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就是說啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不同世界的人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.04,0:10:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,欸欸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅喜歡哪一個？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我推佐知子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.43,0:10:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅果然就是阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再見 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.11,0:10:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你的圖 下次再教我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.61,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.24,0:11:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.16,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 那個… 第一次覺得這麼開心…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次有朋…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.46,0:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次有人拜訪我家…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.50,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我應該有很多招待不周的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,沒能好好招待兩位…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.05,0:11:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,對"朋友"太客氣了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我超開心的喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.18,0:11:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,還看到玩瘋的天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.43,0:11:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,別說了 真的很羞恥…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.94,0:11:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 今天確實很開心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.23,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我才要說… 謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.78,0:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,學校見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.25,0:11:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很好玩耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.50,0:11:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只是玩一下就那麼慎重地道謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.80,0:11:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也太正經了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.30,0:12:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,多久沒玩得這麼瘋了呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.23,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然發生了很多事 但今天真開心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.98,0:12:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.19,0:12:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,房間感覺比平常寬敞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.86,0:12:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友回去之後就是這種感覺嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然伊地知同學說我是朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:28.95,0:12:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但我還不知道她們的聯絡方式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:31.91,0:12:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這個香味…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,簡直就像被她們倆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,包圍著一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.38,0:12:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.80,0:12:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這種變態般的幻想太糟糕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.76,0:12:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,畫張圖來轉移注意…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.85,0:12:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,幻覺天音同學？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因為她剛才就在旁邊畫畫…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.23,0:12:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,睡覺吧…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.07,0:13:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,這張床睡起來真舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,連幻覺伊地知同學都…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 再教我畫畫嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.53,0:13:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一起看閃萌吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.87,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡也有？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,為… 為什麼…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在… 在房間各處…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,辣妹她們…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.42,0:13:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是自己的房間\n卻無處可逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.59,0:13:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.01,0:13:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,早安…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,早…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,之後發生什麼事了嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.61,0:13:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 沒有…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.03,0:13:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,興奮到完全睡不著
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,辣妹太可怕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？伊地知呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她說有事要辦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛… 我有地方想逛的說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學是阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.05,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這點應該已經確定了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放學期間人很少
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同學也不在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.68,0:14:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,現在正是從天音同學口中\n問出真心話的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,絕佳機會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.18,0:14:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.56,0:14:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,妳那個追蹤我的私帳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,請告訴我帳號
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.81,0:14:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,欸？才不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,為… 為什麼？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.52,0:14:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因為除了閃萌之外
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.11,0:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我還按了很多東西讚 很害羞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.65,0:14:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說 妳承認了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.78,0:14:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,承認那個私帳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.70,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就是妳自己的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.45,0:14:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:38.16,0:14:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,既然是妳按的讚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.88,0:14:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,表示那不是妳妹的帳號
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.75,0:14:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,追蹤著身為閃萌宅的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那個私人帳號的存在本身
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.51,0:14:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就是身為阿宅的鐵證
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:57.06,0:14:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,挺厲害的嘛 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.73,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但你太天真了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,窮追猛打的方式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.81,0:15:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,太嫩了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什… 什麼…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.53,0:15:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那個私帳確實是我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.40,0:15:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是！我妹才小學三年級
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.32,0:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是說 那個帳號…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:14.20,0:15:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,難…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.29,0:15:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.83,0:15:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是為了給還沒有手機的妹妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.08,0:15:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看的帳號
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.67,0:15:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,所以妳絕對不是阿宅囉？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,對啦！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.17,0:15:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了… 太遺憾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.01,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,原本想說如果是宅友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,還想試試看這件事的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就是閃萌的即時實況…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.18,0:15:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,帝…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"帝國少女"啦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.48,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,還是說了嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（週日 早晨）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.82,0:15:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌要開始囉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.86,0:15:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的播放讓我比平常更緊張
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.66,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.20,0:15:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和天音同學在私訊中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.37,0:15:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,互相實況
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.87,0:16:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.87,0:16:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是天音同學嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.33,0:16:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是天音同學嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.80,0:16:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,完全沒打算隱藏阿宅身分耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.76,0:16:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但是對方可是辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.97,0:16:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,除了宅之外沒長處的我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不能輸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.72,0:16:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我對閃萌的愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,就展現給妳看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.54,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這場戰爭在動畫結束後\n也持續了整整一天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.13,0:16:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（睡吧 就這麼辦\n謝謝你！今天很開心）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（我也很開心！謝謝妳！\n晚安！晚安）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.23,0:17:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天音早
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.98,0:17:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.10,0:17:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？今天的天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺皮膚水亮亮的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,又是平時那個高冷的天音同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.15,0:17:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天的那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.36,0:17:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,難道只是為了配合我嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅的壞毛病又犯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,晚點去道歉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天真的很棒喔…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好 務必要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.51,0:17:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.76,0:17:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有勉強她…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在學校聊這種話題…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.10,0:17:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.10,0:17:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 妳在說什麼？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:42.10,0:17:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼"很棒喔"
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,還有"下次再玩"
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.31,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是…\n-沒事…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.94,0:17:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.15,0:17:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,天氣！在聊天氣！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.23,0:17:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,離我太遠了吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.45,0:17:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.45,0:17:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌枕套
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,每家Animate都還沒入庫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.12,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,剛發售就無法獲得的稀有周邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.62,0:18:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到會在超市的童裝賣場看到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我也太機靈了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.96,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好 趕快買回家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.55,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,翔 響
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以在店裡亂跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,當媽媽真辛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.43,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 我弟弟…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:27.85,0:18:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.60,0:18:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,安靜點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,妳怎麼會在這裡？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.40,0:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽叫我出來跑腿 我家成員很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.70,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很辛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.78,0:18:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這反差也跟平常差太多了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.41,0:18:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,討厭 一直盯著看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.37,0:18:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在沒化妝 不要盯著我看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.58,0:18:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼會在這種地方碰到 討厭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.46,0:18:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,驚慌失措的伊地知同學真罕見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.34,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅 拜託
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:59.51,0:19:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的事 可以幫我保密嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:06.81,0:19:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.98,0:19:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你很上道嘛 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.90,0:19:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼沒化妝不能看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:12.27,0:19:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,卻可以近距離接觸呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.40,0:19:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,姊姊 這個也要買
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.48,0:19:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙是誰？琴子的男友嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 不要亂說話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉喔 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.46,0:19:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 不會…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,男朋友…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 原來是宅男
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.34,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我有想去的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.59,0:19:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.18,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學 閃萌枕套
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到也買到了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.72,0:19:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.93,0:19:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哪裡有賣？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.35,0:19:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺到一股\n"不要說多餘的話"的視線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.73,0:19:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在超市的童裝賣場
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.23,0:19:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,晚點把位置私訊給妳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,欸？天音和阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.45,0:20:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在Mins互追了嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.20,0:20:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我想試試看閃萌即時實況
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就是之前說的那個私帳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.70,0:20:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,為了我妹開的那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.75,0:20:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,也加我好友嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.63,0:20:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.00,0:20:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,當然可以啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.13,0:20:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你因為覺得是宅男帳號才顧慮我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.22,0:20:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我也覺得跟加真實帳號好友\n很不好意思…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,話說 私訊給天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.30,0:20:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她應該不太會回吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.39,0:20:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,沒那回事喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.23,0:20:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,實況以外的時間聯絡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.44,0:20:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她也馬上就會回
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我的私訊常被她不讀不回耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.32,0:20:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-因為一回妳 妳馬上就打電話來\n-打…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,然後絕對會講很久的電話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.70,0:20:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要私訊給阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.45,0:20:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果妳不嫌棄的話… 請務必
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.58,0:20:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我很開心能跟別人聊閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我也沒其他朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上隨時都有空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.09,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,加Mins好友後\n突然有種變朋友的感覺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.43,0:21:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,人生真的變化莫測
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:14.23,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,訊息來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是誰呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.28,0:21:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,下次假日出來玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.36,0:21:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,去看電影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.11,0:21:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,這週假日有空嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,陪我去逛Animate
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.25,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,分別邀我出門？
